;. /resume_work_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition resume_work
  ;= Continue the original work through its declared action
    Use assess_work and plan_continuation first when intent is unresolved. Bind an explicitly selected answer, retry or resume action for that work, with its current arguments and guards. This flow does not choose an action or fabricate missing input. Original attempts, holes and history remain owned by the existing hand.

    ;@ /flow/input capture
    ;= Frozen own-record capture used when selecting the continuation action

    ;@ /flow/input selection
    ;= selection

    ;@ /flow/input arguments
    ;= arguments

    ;@ /flow/input checks
    ;= checks

    ;@ /flow/input observations
    ;= observations

    ;@ /flow/invoke assessment ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/assess_work_flow/flows/assess_work
    ;@ /flow/bind capture capture
    ;= assessment

    ;@ /flow/step selected ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/work_action
    ;@ /flow/bind assessment assessment
    ;@ /flow/bind selection selection
    ;= selected

    ;@ /flow/invoke actions ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/prepare_action_flow/flows/prepare_action
    ;@ /flow/bind selection selected
    ;@ /flow/bind arguments arguments
    ;= actions

    ;@ /flow/invoke receipts ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/invoke_action_flow/flows/invoke_action
    ;@ /flow/bind actions actions
    ;= receipts

    ;@ /flow/invoke verified ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/verify_action_flow/flows/verify_action
    ;@ /flow/bind receipts receipts
    ;@ /flow/bind checks checks
    ;@ /flow/bind observations observations
    ;= verified

    ;@ /flow/result verified
    ;= Continue the original work through its declared action result
